                    <h2 class="h2">Choose the Camper Style for Your Adventures!</h2>
                    <p class="subheading">Four Wheel Campers offers customizable pop-up campers designed to fit in your truck's bed, providing versatility for any off-roading and camping adventure.</p>
                </div>
            </div><div class="section-body"><div class="container"><ul class="all-models-list-v2"><li class="all-models-box-v2"><div class="v2-box-heading"><h3 class='h3'>Topper - Project M</h3><p class="subheading">Bolts to bed rails</p></div><div class="v2-box-body"><div class="all-models-box-v2-img centered-img"><img width="900" height="600" src="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Topper - Project M" decoding="async" srcset="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey.jpg 900w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey-440x293.jpg 440w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey-768x512.jpg 768w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey-300x200.jpg 300w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey-600x400.jpg 600w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Model-M-Tacoma-model-selector_scaled-grey-64x43.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></div><div class="block-min-price">Starting at <span class="min-price">$12,395</span></div><p class="style-description">A lightweight truck topper with camping capabilities. The Project M allows you to have full use of your truck bed, while having a pop-up camper.</p></div><div class="v2-box-footer"><div class="explore-link-box"><a href="https://fourwheelcampers.com/model/project-m/" class="btn btn-read-more" title="View Models">View Models</a></div></div></li><li class="all-models-box-v2"><div class="v2-box-heading"><h3 class='h3'>Slide-in</h3><p class="subheading">Slides into truck bed</p></div><div class="v2-box-body"><div class="all-models-box-v2-img centered-img"><img width="600" height="400" src="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-slide-in-copy.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Slide-in" decoding="async" srcset="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-slide-in-copy.jpg 600w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-slide-in-copy-440x293.jpg 440w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-slide-in-copy-300x200.jpg 300w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-slide-in-copy-64x43.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></div><div class="block-min-price">Starting at <span class="min-price">$19,495</span></div><p class="style-description">Our slide-in pop up camper that started it all. Over 50 years of fine tuning & perfecting have made this our most popular camper decade after decade.</p></div><div class="v2-box-footer"><div class="explore-link-box"><a href="https://fourwheelcampers.com/all-models/slide-in-popup-truck-campers/" class="btn btn-read-more" title="View Models">View Models</a></div></div></li><li class="all-models-box-v2"><div class="v2-box-heading"><h3 class='h3'>Flatbed</h3><p class="subheading">Remove bed & apply</p></div><div class="v2-box-body"><div class="all-models-box-v2-img centered-img"><img width="600" height="400" src="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-flatbed.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Flatbed" decoding="async" srcset="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-flatbed.jpg 600w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-flatbed-440x293.jpg 440w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-flatbed-300x200.jpg 300w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/admin-ajax-flatbed-64x43.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></div><div class="block-min-price">Starting at <span class="min-price">$41,995</span></div><p class="style-description">Maximize your adventures with our flatbed camper and Norweld Tray. More spacious and more storage for all of your gear.</p></div><div class="v2-box-footer"><div class="explore-link-box"><a href="https://fourwheelcampers.com/all-models/flat-bed-pop-up-truck-camper-mid-and-large-size-trucks/" class="btn btn-read-more" title="View Models">View Models</a></div></div></li><li class="all-models-box-v2"><div class="v2-box-heading"><h3 class='h3'>The CampOut Series</h3><p class="subheading">Slides into truck bed</p></div><div class="v2-box-body"><div class="all-models-box-v2-img centered-img"><img width="900" height="600" src="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="The CampOut Series" decoding="async" srcset="https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy.jpg 900w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy-440x293.jpg 440w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy-300x200.jpg 300w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy-600x400.jpg 600w, https://fourwheelcampers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/campout-model-thumbnail-copy-64x43.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></div><div class="block-min-price">Starting at <span class="min-price">$23,495</span></div><p class="style-description">The newest addition to the FWC Lineup, CampOut. A Modular slide-in pop up truck camper that can be configured for any adventure.</p></div><div class="v2-box-footer"><div class="explore-link-box"><a href="https://fourwheelcampers.com/model/campout/" class="btn btn-read-more" title="View Models">View Models</a></div></div></li><li class="all-models-box-v2 orvis-video"><div class="top-headings-box"><div class="column v2-box-heading"><h3 class=