			.fwc-top-announcement-banner{position:relative;z-index:10001;width:100%;padding:11px 20px;color:#fff;background:#1bbfd3;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:.01em;text-align:center}
			.fwc-top-announcement-banner__inner{max-width:1210px;margin:0 auto}
			.fwc-top-announcement-banner p{margin:0}
			.fwc-top-announcement-banner p+p{margin-top:.35em}
			.fwc-top-announcement-banner a{color:inherit;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px}
			.fwc-top-announcement-banner a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px}
			.anchor-nav-box.build.affix{top:var(--fwc-top-announcement-builder-offset,0px)!important}
			@media (max-width:767px){.fwc-top-announcement-banner{padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}}
		</style>
		<script>
			(function () {
				var banner = document.querySelector('.fwc-top-announcement-banner');
				var queued = false;

				if (!banner) {
					return;
				}

				function updateBuilderOffset() {
					var adminBar = document.getElementById('wpadminbar');
					var adminBarHeight = adminBar ? adminBar.getBoundingClientRect().height : 0;
					var bannerBottom = banner.getBoundingClientRect().bottom;
					var offset = Math.max(adminBarHeight, bannerBottom, 0);

					document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--fwc-top-announcement-builder-offset', offset + 'px');
					queued = false;
				}

				function queueBuilderOffset() {
					if (!queued) {
						queued = true;
						window.requestAnimationFrame(updateBuilderOffset);
					}
				}

				window.addEventListener('scroll', queueBuilderOffset, { passive: true });
				window.addEventListener('resize', queueBuilderOffset);

				if ('ResizeObserver' in window) {
					new ResizeObserver(queueBuilderOffset).observe(banner);
				}

				queueBuilderOffset();
			}());
		</script>
				<div id="fwc-top-announcement-banner-fallback" class="fwc-top-announcement-banner" role="status">
			<div class="fwc-top-announcement-banner__inner">
				<p><strong>PRICE UPDATE - SEPTEMBER 18</strong><br />
Secure today's pricing | <a href="https://fourwheelcampers.com/find-dealer/">visit a showroom</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
				<script>
			(function () {
				var banner = document.getElementById('fwc-top-announcement-banner-fallback');

				if (banner && document.body) {
					banner.removeAttribute('id');
					document.body.insertBefore(banner, document.body.firstChild);
				}
			}());
		</script>
		<div style="display: none;"><div id="boxzilla-box-3996-content"><p><strong>Thank you for your interest in our campers!</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>PRICE UPDATE:</p>
<p>Planning to buy a Four Wheel Camper? Order by September 17th to secure today&#8217;s pricing.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>CURRENT LEAD TIMES:</p>
<p>Lead times are typically 2-3 months depending on location. Please contact your local dealer to see what their current estimate delivery times are.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>VISIT A DEALER:</p>
<p><a id="menur4ne" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://fourwheelcampers.com/contact-us/find-dealer/" href="https://fourwheelcampers.com/contact-us/find-dealer/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" aria-label="Link Four Wheel Campers - Pop Up Truck Camper Leader Since 1972">Four Wheel Campers &#8211; Pop Up Truck Camper Leader Since 1972</a></p>
